**User Strategic Question:** {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.strategic_question }}

**User Context:**
- Company: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.company_name }}
- Role: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.job_function }}
- Market Intelligence: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.market_intelligence }}
- Strategic Context: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.strategic_context }}
- Risk Factors: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.risk_factors }}
- Competitive Landscape: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.competitive_landscape }}
