**User Market Signal Rates:**
- AI Chip Demand: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.user_ai_chip_rate }}%
- Crypto Mining: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.user_crypto_rate }}%
- EV Components: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.user_ev_rate }}%
- Supply Chain Risk: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.user_supply_risk }}%
- Regulatory Risk: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.user_regulatory }}%
- Consumer Electronics: {{ $('Extract Form Data').item.json.user_consumer_rate }}%

**AGENT ANALYSES:**

**1. Market Data Analysis:**
{{ $('Market Data Agent').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

**2. Market Intelligence:**
{{ $('Market Intelligence Agent').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

**3. Strategic Analysis:**
{{ $('Strategic Analysis Agent').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

**4. Risk Management:**
{{ $('Risk Management Agent').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

**5. Competitive Analysis:**
{{ $('Competitive Analysis Agent').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

